Thankyou for downloading my theme, i hope you like it! :)
This theme makes your desktop look like kde-look.org!
I don't know how to make icewm themes so I downloaded Acqua and
changed it as necessary. (Thanks Aronnax!) You might find bits
of Acqua in this theme if you look around *sigh*.

How to install:
1. -IMPORTANT- If you want to use the install script then you
first have to decide whether you want to install for yourself
or system wide. Uncomment the appropriate line in the script.
2. Run the script and hope it works properly.
3. Open KControl into the Window Decoration section.
-or-
Right click on a window border and click "Configure" then go to
Window Decoration.
4. Select IceWM.
5. Go to the Configure tab and select kdelook.
6. Have fun.
